{
  "info": {
    "name": "Tilim API",
    "description": "Tilim (til o'rganish ilovasi) backend API.\n\n## Ishlatish tartibi\n\n1. `Tilim.postman_environment.json` ni Postman'ga import qiling va uni faol environment sifatida tanlang.\n2. **Auth → Register** yoki **Auth → Login** so'rovini yuboring — qaytgan token avtomatik ravishda `{{token}}` o'zgaruvchisiga saqlanadi.\n3. Qolgan himoyalangan so'rovlar shu tokendan foydalanadi (collection darajasida Bearer auth o'rnatilgan).\n4. **Lessons → Create** va **Words → Create** so'rovlari yaratilgan ID'ni `{{lessonId}}` / `{{wordId}}` ga saqlaydi, shuning uchun keyingi GET/PUT/DELETE so'rovlarini qo'lda tahrirlash shart emas.\n\n## Environment o'zgaruvchilari\n\n| O'zgaruvchi | Izoh |\n|---|---|\n| `baseUrl` | API manzili, masalan `http://localhost:5001/api` |\n| `token` | JWT — Login/Register avtomatik to'ldiradi |\n| `lessonId` | Oxirgi yaratilgan dars ID si |\n| `wordId` | Oxirgi yaratilgan so'z ID si |\n\n> Eslatma: macOS'da 5000-portni AirPlay Receiver egallaydi, shuning uchun lokalda 5001 ishlatilgan.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Barcha so'rovlar uchun umumiy tekshiruv: server javob bermay qolmasin",
          "pm.test('Javob 5xx emas', function () {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.below(500);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5001/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "serverUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5001"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{serverUrl}}/",
              "host": [
                "{{serverUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Server tirikligini tekshiradi. Deploy platformalari (Render, Railway) shu manzilni so'raydi.\n\nJavob: `{ \"status\": \"ok\", \"service\": \"tilim API\" }`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Token'ni environment'ga saqlaymiz — keyingi so'rovlar shundan foydalanadi",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token', data.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token saqlandi');",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Javobda parol yo\\'q', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(data).to.not.have.property('password');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Yangi Foydalanuvchi\",\n    \"email\": \"yangi@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Yangi foydalanuvchi yaratadi va darhol JWT qaytaradi.\n\n**Body:** `name`, `email`, `password` (kamida 6 belgi)\n\n**Javoblar:**\n- `201` — yaratildi, javobda token bor\n- `400` — maydon to'ldirilmagan yoki validatsiya xatosi\n- `409` — email allaqachon ro'yxatdan o'tgan\n\n> Muvaffaqiyatli ro'yxatdan o'tish haqida Telegram bot barcha adminlarga xabar yuboradi."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token', data.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token saqlandi');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Tizimga kirish. `npm run seed` dan keyingi test akkaunt: **test@example.com / 123456**\n\n**Javoblar:**\n- `200` — token qaytadi\n- `401` — email yoki parol noto'g'ri (xavfsizlik uchun qaysi biri ekani aytilmaydi)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Me (joriy foydalanuvchi)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Token egasining ma'lumotlari. **Himoyalangan** — `Authorization: Bearer <token>` talab qilinadi.\n\n**Javoblar:**\n- `200` — foydalanuvchi obyekti (parolsiz)\n- `401` — token yo'q, yaroqsiz yoki muddati tugagan"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lessons",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Dars yaratish",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
