                "lessons",
                "{{lessonId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Darsni yangilash. **Himoyalangan** — faqat dars egasi yoki admin.\n\nFaqat yuborilgan maydonlar o'zgaradi (qisman yangilash).\n\n**Javoblar:** `200` | `403` — begona dars | `404` — topilmadi"
          },
          "response": []
